            <p>
                SeeShell's visual approach is ideally suited for automating and testing Flash and Silverlight applets.
                Your automated user interface testing benefits from the extensive Flash/Silverlight Test Automation support that SeeShell offers.

                With SeeShell, every team member can create and run Flash/Silverlight regression tests. The use of SeeShell requires no knowledge of the
                internal workings of Flash/Silverlight, its objects or its UI elements. SeeShell works on the visual appearance, just like a normal end-user does.

